title: "Has the South American low-level jet changed? Radiosonde evidence and the limits set by the observing system, 1980–2025: analysis code"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Nesis
    given-names: Juan
    affiliation: "Independent researcher, Buenos Aires, Argentina"
