abstract: >-
  Code that reproduces the analysis of the frequency of the South American low-level jet in IGRA v2 radiosondes (31 stations,
  1980–2025), the effect of archive sources, wind breaks, vertical resolution and sounding noise, and the comparison with ERA5.
